@startuml
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "User" as User
box "Data Quality Inspector System" #LightYellow
participant "User Interface\n(Web Browser)" as UI
participant "File Handling\nComponent" as FileHandler
participant "Error Message\nHandling" as ErrorHandler
participant "Data Quality Analysis\nComponent" as Analyzer
participant "Report Generation\nComponent" as Reporter
participant "Cleaning & Comparison\nComponent" as Cleaner
end box

== Phase 1: Upload & File Validation ==
User -> UI: Upload CSV file
UI -> FileHandler: Send raw file stream
alt File corrupted / invalid schema
    FileHandler -> ErrorHandler: Trigger file reading error
    ErrorHandler --> UI: Display validation error
    UI --> User: Show error alert
else Valid CSV format
    FileHandler -> Analyzer: Forward validated dataset
    
    == Phase 2: Quality Inspection & Reporting ==
    Analyzer -> Analyzer: Detect anomalies, missing values & types
    Analyzer -> Reporter: Pass detected issues & analysis metrics
    Reporter --> UI: Deliver quality report & cleaning suggestions
    UI --> User: Render inspection dashboard
end

== Phase 3: User Approval & Safe Cleaning ==
User -> UI: Approve suggested cleaning actions
UI -> Cleaner: Dispatch user-approved cleaning rules
Cleaner -> Cleaner: Execute transformations (Original preserved)
Cleaner --> UI: Return cleaned dataset & Before/After diff
UI --> User: Enable download & show comparative summary
@enduml
